  "details": "(This text is using translation)\n\n1. It seems that when using a specific BUFFALO router, the connection to VRChat times out.\n\n2. I have been experiencing issues since March 23.\n\n3. The cause was unknown, but it was found that people experiencing the issue were using specific routers.\n\n4. There was information on X stating that changing the problematic router resolved the issue, so it might be due to compatibility between VRChat and the router.\n\n5. Even when using the problematic router, connecting to VRChat becomes possible by using a Virtual Private Network, but I would be glad if the issue could be resolved.\n\n6. The following are routers confirmed to have connection issues:\n\n1166DHPL (the one I am using)\n\n1166DHPL2 (used by someone else who experienced the issue)\n\nI hope this issue gets resolved. Thank you for letting us have fun!",
